# Where the client sends API requests. The default, /v1, goes to this project's mock API
# through Vite's proxy. To use your own Go or FastAPI taskboard-api instead, start it with
# CORS_ORIGINS set to this app's origin, set its address here, and run npm run dev:web:
# VITE_API_BASE=http://localhost:23017/v1
